.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Represents the payload sent to a remote Web‑API based \fBAI\fP backend\&. 

This struct is serialized into JSON and transmitted via HTTP POST\&. It contains:
.IP "\(bu" 2
The target URL
.IP "\(bu" 2
The system prompt
.IP "\(bu" 2
The raw user prompt
.IP "\(bu" 2
Context information
.IP "\(bu" 2
Additional model parameters
.PP

.PP
The generic type \fIT\fP  represents the raw prompt type used by the model (e\&.g\&., string, structured object)\&.

.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIT\fP The type of the raw prompt passed to the backend\&. 
.RE
